<title>USA: Advanced Environmental resumes operations.</title>
<headline>Advanced Environmental resumes operations.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGDALE, Ark. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Environmental Recycling Technologies Inc said Thursday it has resumed operations and recycled plastics processing at its plant in Rogers, Arkansas.</p>
<p>A fire last weekend partially damaged a storage section of the facility.</p>
<p>The company said it does not expect the fire to cause any supply disruptions to its customers.</p>
<p>The cause of the fire remains under investigation.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
